  "prefLabel": "Plc 212.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 212.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the circumstances constituting an emergency or loss of funding for purposes of waiving the requirements of RSA 21-G:37, I - IV, as contemplated by RSA 21-G:37, V.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
